OL,3,GNEWSAMan beats fell challenge after
OL,4,Anear-fatal attempt
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour years after showing no signs of
OL,7,Flife while being saved by mountain
OL,8,Frescuers, a fell runner has returned to
OL,9,Fconquer the hills that nearly killed
OL,10,Fhim.
OL,12,FIn 2022, Tommy Price became unwell
OL,13,Fwhile attempting a running challenge in
OL,14,Fthe Lake District and suffered a
OL,15,Fcardiac arrest triggered by
OL,16,Fhypothermia.
OL,18,FThe 26-year-old, who was helped by
OL,19,FKeswick Mountain Rescue, has now
OL,20,Freturned and completed the 66 mile
OL,21,F(106km) Bob Graham Round.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
