OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F401A1789057571
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMan beats fell challenge after
OL,4,Anear-fatal attempt
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrice, who said he had been given a
OL,7,F"second chance" by the rescue team who
OL,8,Freturned to greet him at the finish
OL,9,Fline, explained: "I am very lucky to be
OL,10,Falive and even luckier to be able to
OL,11,Frun still. It was unfinished business
OL,12,Fand I had to do it to finish the
OL,13,Fstory."
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
